    "regime_notes": "10-day IC was positive in 2025-2026 (+0.09978061), 2027-2029 (+0.02305010), and 2030-2034 (+0.03475437). ICIR for those regimes was +0.283316, +0.095738, and +0.138254 respectively. The 20-day decay was stronger (+0.03803915), while 40-day predictive power faded (+0.00179646). Interpret uncertainty conservatively because the cross-section is only 15 assets, despite the long date history."
